// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// CI — Angular Frontend
// Déclenché à chaque git push
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
pipeline {
    agent any

    environment {
        SERVICE_DIR = 'frontend'
        IMAGE_NAME  = 'nesrrine/certifypro-frontend'
        COMMIT_SHA  = "${env.GIT_COMMIT?.take(7) ?: 'latest'}"
    }

    tools {
        nodejs 'NodeJS-20'   // configuré dans Jenkins → Global Tool Configuration
    }

    stages {

        stage('1 — Checkout') {
            steps {
                checkout scm
                echo "✅ Code récupéré — commit: ${env.COMMIT_SHA}"
            }
        }

        stage('2 — npm ci') {
            steps {
                dir("${SERVICE_DIR}") {
                    sh 'npm ci'
                    echo '✅ Dépendances installées depuis package-lock.json'
                }
            }
        }

        stage('3 — ng build production') {
            steps {
                dir("${SERVICE_DIR}") {
                    sh 'npx ng build --configuration production'
                    echo '✅ Build Angular production généré dans dist/'
                }
            }
            post {
                always {
                    archiveArtifacts artifacts: "${SERVICE_DIR}/dist/**/*",
                                     allowEmptyArchive: true
                }
            }
        }

        stage('4 — Docker Build') {
            steps {
                dir("${SERVICE_DIR}") {
                    sh "docker build -t ${IMAGE_NAME}:${COMMIT_SHA} -t ${IMAGE_NAME}:latest ."
                    echo "✅ Image ${IMAGE_NAME}:${COMMIT_SHA} créée avec Nginx"
                }
            }
        }
    }

    post {
        success {
            echo "🎉 CI frontend réussi — déclenchement CD avec tag ${COMMIT_SHA}"
            build job: 'frontend-CD',
                  wait: false,
                  parameters: [string(name: 'IMAGE_TAG', value: "${COMMIT_SHA}")]
        }
        failure { echo '❌ CI frontend échoué' }
    }
}
